@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

### === VOUCHERS ===

### Crea un voucher → 201
# @name createVoucher
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validityStartDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validityEndDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "amount": 10.00
}

### Leggi il voucher appena creato → 200
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/{{createVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Leggi un voucher inesistente → 404
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Crea un voucher con date invertite → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validityStartDate": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "validityEndDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "amount": 10.00
}

### Crea un voucher con importo non positivo → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validityStartDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validityEndDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "amount": 0
}

### Annulla il voucher → 200, CanceledOn valorizzato
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/{{createVoucher.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### Annulla di nuovo lo stesso voucher → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/{{createVoucher.response.body.$.id}}/cancel

### Annulla un voucher inesistente → 404
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

### === CONFERMA ORDINE CON VOUCHER (setup) ===

### Crea un prodotto
# @name voucherProduct
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cuffie",
  "price": 40.00,
  "description": "Bluetooth"
}

### Crea un ordine (subtotale 40.00)
# @name voucherOrder
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{voucherProduct.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Crea un secondo ordine, per provare il riuso del voucher
# @name voucherOrder2
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    { "productId": "{{voucherProduct.response.body.$.id}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Crea un voucher da 15.00
# @name redeemableVoucher
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validityStartDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validityEndDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "amount": 15.00
}

### Crea un voucher da 100.00, più alto del subtotale
# @name bigVoucher
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validityStartDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validityEndDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "amount": 100.00
}

### === CONFERMA ORDINE CON VOUCHER ===

### Conferma con un voucher inesistente → 404
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{{voucherOrder.response.body.$.id}}/confirm?voucherId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Conferma con il voucher annullato sopra → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{{voucherOrder.response.body.$.id}}/confirm?voucherId={{createVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Conferma con un voucher più alto del subtotale → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{{voucherOrder.response.body.$.id}}/confirm?voucherId={{bigVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Conferma con il voucher da 15.00 → 200, Status: Confirmed, Total: 25.00
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{{voucherOrder.response.body.$.id}}/confirm?voucherId={{redeemableVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Il voucher risulta riscattato → 200, RedeemedOn valorizzato
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/{{redeemableVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Riusa lo stesso voucher su un altro ordine → 400, già riscattato
### (il 409 scatta solo con due conferme concorrenti, non riproducibile da qui)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{{voucherOrder2.response.body.$.id}}/confirm?voucherId={{redeemableVoucher.response.body.$.id}}

### Annulla un voucher già riscattato → 400
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/vouchers/{{redeemableVoucher.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
